          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korekoghe na chumba chimu a mbengenyi ya lukumbi chiko na mnyango ghwaro, andu vizongona vekorwa vioghosherwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aeni aho lukumbinyi lwa mbengenyi, korekoghe na meza iwi kula luwaru, andu vizongona vekorwa, na vizongona va kaung'a, na vizongona va malipo vibwaghilwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbengenyi cha shighadi ya lukumbi ichia ya mbenge ya kaskazinyi, korekoghe na meza iwi, na ija chia ya lukumbi lwa mbengenyi, korekoghe na meza rimu iwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korekoghe na meza inya nandenyi na meza inya cha shighadi ya mbenge; rose ni meza wunyanya andu nyamandu ra vizongona ribwaghilwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena wokoni korekoghe na meza ra magho ghiwachilo kwa wundu ghwa vizongona vekora; wulacha ghwaro na wushapa ghodekatana, sentimeta mirongo mfungade na isanu kwa mirongo mfungade na isanu; na wuighu ghwaro ghwa sentimeta mirongo misanu; vilambo vebwagha vizongona verewikiloghe aighu yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koleo ra wulacha ghwa milimeta mirongo mfungade na isanu rikafungwa kurimara iro meza nandenyi. Nyama refunya kizongona rikakaia riwiko aighu mezenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
